0..73 Comment "// A dependent arrow whose codomain ignores its binder is the plain arrow"
74..149 Comment "// (#577). A family applied at its binder is a dependent codomain until the"
150..224 Comment "// family is read; a family that reads to one type at every argument makes"
225..297 Comment "// the function type over it the arrow to that type, in both directions."
